WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
A laptop runs the Whonix app -- a padlock
logo on black -- on a Windows desktop: "Booting.."

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Still on Windows, the window shows "Anonymize.."
then the host switches to a Linux desktop.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
On an Ubuntu desktop (left dock, Activities bar),
the same Whonix window reads "Secure..."

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The host becomes macOS (top menu bar, Dock);
the Whonix window shows "Protect..."

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.500
On macOS the message changes to "Done." --
the Whonix app has finished its startup.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Full-screen Whonix logo on black:
"Ready for Linux", then "Ready for KVM".

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.200
Final text under the Whonix logo:
"Ready for everyone."
